    {
      "kind": "grammar_point",
      "external_id": "g_b1_solving_problems_suggestions",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "b1-solving-problems-01",
        "slug": "b1-solving-problems-suggestions",
        "title": "Suggestion forms",
        "rule_summary": "Use could, why don't we, how about + -ing, and let's to suggest options with different levels of directness.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "برای پیشنهاد راه‌حل از could، why don't we، how about + ing و let's استفاده می‌کنیم."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "We could call them.",
            "fa": "می‌تونیم بهشون زنگ بزنیم."
          },
          {
            "en": "How about moving the meeting online?",
            "fa": "چطوره جلسه رو آنلاین کنیم؟"
          }
        ],
        "cefr": "B1",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "grammar_point",
      "external_id": "g_b1_solving_problems_conditional",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "b1-solving-problems-02",
        "slug": "b1-solving-problems-conditional",
        "title": "First conditional for solutions",
        "rule_summary": "Use if + present to test realistic options and likely results.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "برای بررسی گزینه‌های واقعی و نتیجه احتمالی از شرط نوع اول استفاده می‌کنیم."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "If we leave now, we'll avoid traffic.",
            "fa": "اگر الان راه بیفتیم از ترافیک دور می‌مونیم."
          },
          {
            "en": "If that doesn't work, we can try plan B.",
            "fa": "اگر جواب نداد، می‌تونیم برنامه دوم رو امتحان کنیم."
          }
        ],
        "cefr": "B1",
        "status": "approved"
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "grammar_point",
      "external_id": "g_b1_solving_problems_agreement",
      "data": {
        "lesson_key": "b1-solving-problems-03",
        "slug": "b1-solving-problems-agreement",
        "title": "Reaching agreement",
        "rule_summary": "Use phrases such as That sounds practical, I can work with that, or Let's go with… to close a problem-solving discussion.",
        "explanation": {
          "fa": "برای جمع‌بندی و توافق از عبارت‌هایی مثل That sounds practical، I can work with that و Let's go with استفاده می‌کنیم."
        },
        "examples": [
          {
            "en": "Let's go with the second option.",
            "fa": "بریم با گزینه دوم."
          },
          {
            "en": "I can work with that.",
            "fa": "با اون می‌تونم کنار بیام."
